<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.83 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.10 vs   0.16</p>
